WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.300
When I was little, we used to move all the time

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:29.280
I would write these notes
and I would fold them up really small

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.180
And I would hide them

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.220
What'd they say?

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.300
They were just, like, things I wanted to remember...

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.040
so that if I ever wanted to go back
there'd be a piece of me there waiting

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:16.900
What is it you like about this house so much?

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:17.740
History

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:35.660
A writer writes a novel

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:38.000
A songwriter writes a song

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:40.460
We do what we can to endure

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.580
We build our legacy piece by piece

00:01:56.620 --> 00:02:00.500
And maybe the whole world will remember you
or maybe just a couple of people...

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:05.020
but you do what you can
to make sure you're still around after you're gone

